Functions $f_1$, $f_{10}$ (Fig.~\ref{fig:binaryneighbourhod}b),
$f_{39}$, $f_{28}$, $f_{35}$ (Fig.~\ref{fig:binaryneighbourhod}g), $f_{40}$ (Fig.~\ref{fig:binaryneighbourhod}h), $f_{12}$ (Fig.~\ref{fig:4neighbourhod}a), $f_{14}$ (Fig.~\ref{fig:4neighbourhod}b), $f_{19}$ (Fig.~\ref{fig:4neighbourhod}c), $f_{20}$ (Fig.~\ref{fig:4neighbourhod}d), $f_{37}$ (Fig.~\ref{fig:8neighbourhod}c), 
