values $m_{ij}$ and $\kappa_{i,j}$. For each nonempty bucket $b_{\ell}$ we compute the pair $(x_\ell,y_\ell)= (\ell\cdot0.001, \frac{\sum_{m\in b_\ell}m}{|b_\ell|})$. 
