\caption{Panel (a) shows the comparison of energy deposited untagged $\gamma$-rays spectrum from $\mathrm{{}^{241}Am}$-$\mathrm{{}^{9}Be}$ source and the $\gamma$-rays from natural background (without source) in $\mathrm{CeBr_{3}}$ detector. Panel (b) shows the TOF vs. $\gamma$ energy deposited spectrum in $\mathrm{CeBr_{3}}$ detector within the time coincidence of 100 ns between PSBs and $\mathrm{CeBr_{3}}$ detector.}
\label{fig:2} 
