\]  
three complexes:  
\[
\mC = \{ X_1 + X_2, \ 2X_2, \ X_3 \},
\]  
and four reactions:  
\[
\mR = \{ X_1 + X_2 \to X_3, \quad  
2X_2 \to X_1 + X_2, \quad  
2X_2 \to X_3, \quad  
X_3 \to 2X_1 + 3X_2 \}.
\]
