The inset of (a) shows the overlaps of $\rho_{A}$ with different charge sectors ranging from $\{0, \ldots, N/4\}$.  
% QME exists 
The QME is observed in U(1)-symmetric random circuits while it is absent in random circuits without any symmetry. Figure reprinted from Ref.~\cite{liu2024symmetry}.}
