The same issue as Workspace.Flag1 occurs for Workspace.Flag2.

\subsubsection{Modified Rule:}
There does not seem to be an easy solution to this issue in Gray's version. Gacs' work does not suffer from this issue, as the Workspace computation only uses information from its own cell and 2 neighbors.

