%          &=\mathbb{E}\left[\lambda\int_0^Te^{-\beta |\tau-t|}dX_t^{i}+\lambda\int_0^{\tau-} e^{-\beta (\tau-t)}\sum_{j\not=i}dX_t^{j}\bigg|\mathcal{F}_{\tau-}\right]
